ind":"announcement","title":"Ghost Hunting Journal joins Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Dear players,Ghost Hunting Journal is taking part in Steam Next Fest!Join Jolin and Joe for their first supernatural investigation in our free demo, featuring the first of the full game's three story chapters. Explore a city of urban legends, talk to its residents and solve puzzles as you uncover what's behind the haunting.The demo now includes a hint system to help with certain puzzles, along with important bug fixes. If you played a demo build from before the recent update, please start a new ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T05:30:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693783","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1846018067940017","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"update","title":"The demo update is here with a new hint system!","summary":"Dear players, The Ghost Hunting Journal demo has been updated!Stuck on a puzzle? The new hint system offers help with certain puzzles so you can keep investigating. This update also includes major bug fixes.As this version contains a significant number of changes, saves from older demo versions are no longer compatible. To avoid running into game-breaking bugs, please start a new game!Thank you for your patience, and we hope you enjoy the updated demo! Bug fixes and optimizationsJolin's jacket c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T05:10:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940017","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1839041357034820","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"update","title":"Localized Demo Update Now Available!","summary":"Dear players, The updated demo is now available in English, Japanese and Portuguese.This release includes the latest Chapter 1 revisions introduced in the July 20 update, including changes to the story, character motivations and event progression, along with new NPCs, improved dialogue and gameplay refinements. As this version contains a significant number of changes, saves from older demo versions are no longer compatible. To avoid running into game-breaking bugs, please start a new game!Thank ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T05:00:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357034820","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1838407329264743","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Now Available in Chinese!","summary":"Dear players, The updated demo is now available in Chinese.This update introduces a substantially revised Chapter 1, featuring changes to the story, character motivations and event progression, along with new NPCs, improved dialogue and further refinements to the ghost-hunting experience. As this version contains a significant number of changes, saves from older demo versions are no longer compatible. To avoid running into game-breaking bugs, please start a new game! Please note that language se","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T05:00:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329264743","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1838407329258483","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Coming Soon!","summary":"Dear players, A major update for the demo will be released in stages on 20 July 2026 and 27 July 2026 at 1:00 PM (UTC+8).This update brings substantial changes to Chapter 1. The story has been revised, with updates to character motivations, event progression and the overall narrative flow. Several new NPCs have also been introduced, dialogue for a number of characters has been refined, and the ghost-hunting experience has been improved through a range of gameplay adjustments.If you've already co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-17T05:00:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329258483","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1829528821309270","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"update","title":"New Demo Update is out now!","summary":"OptimizationAdded two new auto-save points: one after first entering the office, and another before the moment when the player needs to provoke Xiao Hui’s spirit.Added multiple hint dialogue lines, such as during the office exploration phase with Jiao Yang and the spirit board (Ouija board) phase.LocalizationImproved English and Japanese translations.Try our newest demo and wishlist our game! Also please post your review and checkout out our social media here: X Link Discord Link","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-10T06:58:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821309270","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1828894815566973","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"announcement","title":"New Extended Demo Trailer","summary":"New demo content will be released on April 10 !Stay tuned! Discord: https://discord.gg/WPCmhTTnz8 X: https://x.com/SpicyLao","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-07T10:17:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815566973","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1816849002014406","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"update","title":"Version 0.7.85 Update","summary":"Bug Fixes:Fixed the issue where the interaction icon sometimes fails to display when the paper doll passes by while Joe overlaps with the interaction point.Fixed the issue where the interaction icon sometimes fails to display when Joe passes by the clothes on the floor in Jolin's room.Optimizations:Expanded the contact area of interaction points, with special optimization focused on office interaction points.Optimized the hints for the keycard retrieval puzzle in Foresight International Building","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-21T15:25:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816849002014406","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1816307528968362","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"update","title":"Version 0.7.84 Update","summary":"Bug Fixes:Fixed an issue where the O key shortcut was not blocked after opening the OMG system, which caused directional movement to become unresponsive after repeated key presses exited the interface.Fixed an issue where ghosts would stop appearing after Jolin entered and then exited the conference room during the Obsession Item collection phase.Fixed an issue where Jolin would not fall back to the ground after being hit and knocked back if the down key was pressed right before a ghost attack.F","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-16T13:49:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816307528968362","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1814309641571194","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"update","title":"Version 0.7.83 Update","summary":"Bug Fixes:Fixed an issue where Brad could clip through Kardashian's desk.Optimizations:Revised some of the English dialogue lines.Added a prompt reminding players to equip items from the bedroom wardrobe before leaving Jolin's home.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-27T13:58:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1814309641571194","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1813041031339862","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"update","title":"Version 0.7.82 Update","summary":"Bug Fixes:Fixed an issue where Jolin could become unable to move under certain circumstances during the obsession items' collection phase.Fixed a task display error that occurred when scene transition happened simultaneously with daily task updates in Jolin's home.Fixed an issue where the platform gate layer might not be cleared after returning to the small plaza from the city rail station.Fixed an issue where the Paper Doll would become immobile if its timer ended while entering the meeting roo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-13T14:39:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813041031339862","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1811772772640221","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"update","title":"Version 0.7.81 Update","summary":"Bug Fixes:Fixed an issue where Joe's interaction point remained in the office building lobby after quest completion.Fixed a display error with the \"Task\" indicator at Jolin's home.Fixed an issue where the trash bin objective lacked an interaction icon during the 'Obsession Items' collection phase.Fixed an issue where the Polaroid quest marker remained visible after successful completion of the Purification quest.Optimizations:Adjusted the story dialogue and lines before Heather's spirit core's r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-07T14:32:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772640221","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1811772772443870","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"update","title":"Version 0.7.80 Update","summary":"Optimizations： Changed Menu/Cancel key to Esc or X, and Confirm key to F or Enter. Restructured the task flow in Jolin's home. Improved guidance prompts for the ghost detection tool. Added a counter display for Taking Instant Photos task. Enhanced hints for Meeting Room Locked Again task. Added a prompt to indicate whether all items for the purification box have been collected. Improved hints for the hidden item locked behind the chair. Adjusted the OMG email page-turning method.Bug Fixes： Fixed","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-01T13:56:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772443870","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1811772772330093","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"update","title":"Version 0.7.70 Update","summary":"Bug Fixed: Fixed incorrect game ICON display. Corrected the wrong button prompt in the meeting room during the purification item collection phase. Fixed the voodoo doll issue where targeting the wrong person still angered the soul.Optimizations: Added a language switching function to the title screen. Adjusted the distance of some interactive locations in the office. Improved the Instant Camera Photo task prompts. Enhanced navigation prompts for the Foresight International Tower task. Improved p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-28T04:21:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772330093","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1811772772200034","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"update","title":"Version 0.7.69 Update","summary":"Bugs fixed:Purification Box Issue: Fixed the inability to exit by pressing \"X\" when fewer than 4 items are placed in the box.Paper Doll Count Error: In the office building lobby, the number of paper dolls wrongly counted as 0 when 1 was left.Menu Freeze Bug: Fixed the player being unable to move right after closing the menu due to Joe's shield skill.Optimization:Task Key Binding: Changed the \"Alt\" key function from \"hold\" to \"click\" for task activation.Purification Box UI: - Added error hints fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-24T05:21:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772200034","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3646950-1811138915541968","game_id":"steam-3646950","kind":"update","title":"Version 0.7.68 Update","summary":"Bug Fixed:In Jolin's room, Joe's defense against the Peachwood Sword fails to trigger the storyline.The player can walk upward through the wall near the meeting room door.After the purification, detection items remain usable.Optimizations:Revised the dialogue after failed Spirit Pad attempts, strengthening the connection between ghost reactions and questions.Updated the OMG email to clarify the descri